Midnight Daśaratha recalls past misdeed --- Daśaratha cites mango felled palāśa watered --- Youthful regent hunts Sarayū in rains --- Mistaking pot sound for elephant he shoots --- Human cry reveals struck water-bearing ascetic --- Dying youth mourns helpless old parents --- Daśaratha drops bow and finds victim --- Dying youth rebukes royal shooter --- Youth directs king to blind father hut --- King draws shaft as youth names mixed birth